SUMMARY:Anu Vaidyanathan: Allegory
LOCATION:Just the Tonic at The Caves\, 253 Cowgate\, Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Allegory is a surreal\, deeply personal hour about locating one
 's identity in the tangled constellation of colleagues\, family\, and frien
 ds... while caring for a metaphorical (and possibly real) pet octopus with 
 digestive issues. With themes circling immigrant parenthood\, working-woman
  hustle\, and the illusion of freedom\, Vaidyanathan's latest work is fast-
 paced\, fearless\, and playfully philosophical.\nMore info: https://comedya
 tlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/anu-vaidyanathan-allegory/
